  "id": "section-916",
  "title": "关于军队整训的指示——给林彪同志的信",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-296.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>296)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n林彪同志：<br>\n<br>\n　　各地军队都应整训一个短时期，时间10——14天为宜，已经整训过的，一个月或三个月再整训一次，全军三支两军人员，每一个月或两个月，都应整训一次，发扬成绩，纠正错误，以利再战。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-295.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-297.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
